{
  "info": {
    "name": "ConnectX API — CON-71 & CON-72 Testing",
    "_postman_id": "con-71-72-collection",
    "description": "Test collection for Discovery Mode Onboarding Required (CON-71) and viewer_context-aware Matches, Chat & Team APIs (CON-72).\n\nSet the base variables before running:\n- `base_url`: e.g. http://localhost:8000\n- `token`: Bearer token from login",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",    "value": "YOUR_BEARER_TOKEN_HERE", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "match_id", "value": "REPLACE_WITH_MATCH_ID",  "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "📁 CON-72 — Matches API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Matches (as Startup/Founder)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches?viewer_context=startup&status=active&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" },
                { "key": "status",         "value": "active" },
                { "key": "page",           "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit",          "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns matches as a Founder. Response includes `viewer_context: 'startup'`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Matches (as Talent/Individual)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches?viewer_context=talent&page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "viewer_context", "value": "talent" },
                { "key": "page",           "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit",          "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns matches as an Individual/Talent. Response includes `viewer_context: 'talent'`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Matches (No viewer_context — fallback)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches?page=1&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page",  "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "No viewer_context provided. Backend auto-detects based on user's default profile (startup owner → startup, else → talent)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "🚫 GET Matches — CON-71: Missing Startup Profile (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches?viewer_context=startup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" }]
            },
            "description": "Expected 409 when a talent-only user requests viewer_context=startup.\n\nExpected response:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"error\": { \"code\": \"DISCOVERY_ONBOARDING_REQUIRED\", \"details\": { \"reason\": \"MISSING_STARTUP_PROFILE\" } }\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Match Analysis (as Startup)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches/{{match_id}}/analysis?viewer_context=startup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches", "{{match_id}}", "analysis"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" }]
            },
            "description": "Returns match analysis with viewer_context=startup echoed in the response envelope."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Match Analysis (as Talent)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches/{{match_id}}/analysis?viewer_context=talent",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches", "{{match_id}}", "analysis"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "talent" }]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📁 CON-72 — Chat / Conversations API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Conversations (as Startup/Founder)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations?viewer_context=startup&limit=20&page=1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" },
                { "key": "limit",          "value": "20" },
                { "key": "page",           "value": "1" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns conversations scoped to the startup side. `viewer_context: 'startup'` echoed in response."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Conversations (as Talent)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations?viewer_context=talent&limit=20&page=1",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "viewer_context", "value": "talent" },
                { "key": "limit",          "value": "20" },
                { "key": "page",           "value": "1" }
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "🚫 GET Conversations — CON-71: Missing Talent Profile (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/conversations?viewer_context=talent",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "conversations"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "talent" }]
            },
            "description": "Expected 409 when a startup-only user (not onboarded as talent) requests viewer_context=talent."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📁 CON-72 — Team Overview API",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Team Overview (as Startup/Founder)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/me/startup/team-overview?viewer_context=startup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "startup", "team-overview"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" }]
            },
            "description": "Returns founder-facing team data:\n- startup summary\n- team roster with edit/remove actions\n- sent invitations (direction: sent)\n- `addFromMatches: true`"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Team Overview (as Talent/Joiner)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/me/startup/team-overview?viewer_context=talent",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "startup", "team-overview"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "talent" }]
            },
            "description": "Returns joiner-facing team data:\n- myApplications with stats\n- received invitations (direction: received) with accept/decline actions\n- joinedStartup summary if already a member"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "✅ GET Team Overview (No viewer_context — fallback)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/me/startup/team-overview",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "startup", "team-overview"]
            },
            "description": "No viewer_context. Backend auto-detects. Startup owners default to 'startup', others to 'talent'."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "🚫 GET Team Overview — CON-71: Missing Startup (409)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/me/startup/team-overview?viewer_context=startup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "me", "startup", "team-overview"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" }]
            },
            "description": "Expected 409 DISCOVERY_ONBOARDING_REQUIRED with MISSING_STARTUP_PROFILE when a talent-only user requests startup context."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📁 CON-71 — Error Response Scenarios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "🔴 Expected 409: Talent-only → viewer_context=startup",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches?viewer_context=startup",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "startup" }]
            },
            "description": "Talent-only user (no Startup record) requesting startup context.\n\nExpected response body:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Set up your startup before using this mode.\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"DISCOVERY_ONBOARDING_REQUIRED\",\n    \"details\": {\n      \"reason\": \"MISSING_STARTUP_PROFILE\",\n      \"required_profile_type\": \"startup\",\n      \"requested_viewer_context\": \"startup\",\n      \"next_action\": \"START_ONBOARDING\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "🔴 Expected 409: Startup-only (not onboarded) → viewer_context=talent",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/matches?viewer_context=talent",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "matches"],
              "query": [{ "key": "viewer_context", "value": "talent" }]
            },
            "description": "Startup-only user (is_onboarded=false) requesting talent context.\n\nExpected response body:\n```json\n{\n  \"success\": false,\n  \"message\": \"Create your individual profile before using this mode.\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"DISCOVERY_ONBOARDING_REQUIRED\",\n    \"details\": {\n      \"reason\": \"MISSING_TALENT_PROFILE\",\n      \"required_profile_type\": \"talent\",\n      \"requested_viewer_context\": \"talent\",\n      \"next_action\": \"START_ONBOARDING\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n```"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
